    "turn_text": "Now, some of that's always going to exist in any administration, but you were coming into one had a very particular problem, which is that some of those early hires in the Trump administration were not people who supported President Trump's agenda. There's a ton of very in the weeds reasons for why that was the case. But in that last year, a year and a half, it was really a new administration because of folks like yourself and John McEntee and others that were brought in. What was that like to have to root out the rats?",
