    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/6/96855.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 106,
    "turn_text": "Well, I think it's disappointing in one, I mean, in that you think, okay, you've got someone who wants to come in and drain the swamp and yet many of the hires that were recommended by people in Washington, D.C. just filled the swamp back up",
