    "turn_idx": 109,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, it's one of the interesting tests of this experience, I think, is that all around the country you talk to people, including some people who are maybe conservative donors or people like yourself who run for Congress, there's a phrase that gets trotted out a lot. I'm curious what your thoughts on it now. We should just run politics more like a business. Do you think that's a sentence that holds water much at this point",
