        "text": "Choppy waters and chaos present opportunities for advancing specific causes.",
        "confidence": 0.97
      },
      {
        "text": "Winning elections requires more than rejecting opponents; it demands clear self-definition.",
        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "Authenticity is a key factor in electoral success.",
