      },
      {
        "text": "When facing chaotic situations, one should analyze them to identify lessons.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "People who genuinely represent mainstream values ('Main Street') are more effective than those aligned with political elites ('K Street').",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Donald Trump has demonstrated success in winning elections through both differentiation and strong self-positioning.",
