    "turn_idx": 129,
    "turn_text": "Well, I think that you're right that chaos is an opportunity. And I think that the nice thing is, is that everything that we've been saying for years has been proven right. The establishment ran on a vapid empty agenda. Literally, it was Joe Biden likes ice cream cones. So the left had orange man bad. It was ice cream man bad. That was",
